1 + 2 * 3      = 7   rpn: 1 2 3 * +
(1 + 2) * 3    = 9   rpn: 1 2 + 3 *
2 ^ 3 ^ 2      = 512   rpn: 2 3 2 ^ ^
-2 ^ 2         = -4   rpn: 2 2 ^ neg
10 / 3 * 3     = 9   rpn: 10 3 / 3 *
7 - 2 - 1      = 4   rpn: 7 2 - 1 -
-(4 + 1) * 2   = -10   rpn: 4 1 + neg 2 *
